   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🧠🤖 第4周-Day6 ⚡ 代码实战：本地搭建完整RAG系统\n",
    "\n",
    "今天我们要动手搭建一个完整的RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）系统！这是大模型应用最实用的技术之一，可以解决知识更新和幻觉问题。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🎯 任务目标\n",
    "\n",
    "用sentence-transformers做Embedding + ChromaDB存储 + 本地Qwen2-7B推理，搭建一个能回答技术文档问题的智能问答系统。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📦 环境准备"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 安装必要的依赖\n",
    "!pip install -q sentence-transformers chromadb transformers torch accelerate bitsandbytes\n",
    "!pip install -q faiss-cpu  # 如果用GPU版本可以用 faiss-gpu\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import json\n",
    "from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer\n",
    "from transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForCausalLM, pipeline\n",
    "import chromadb\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from tqdm import tqdm\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 环境准备完成！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📝 Step 1: 加载预训练模型"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 加载embedding模型 - 中文文本语义理解\n",
    "embedding_model = SentenceTransformer('paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 加载本地模型 - Qwen2-7B-Instruct（需要先下载）\n",
    "# 注意：首次运行会下载模型，约13GB，需要一些时间\n",
    "model_name = \"Qwen/Qwen2-7B-Instruct\"\n",
    "tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name, trust_remote_code=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 使用4bit量化减少内存占用\n",
    "model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n",
    "    model_name,\n",
    "    device_map=\"auto\",  # 自动分配到可用设备\n",
    "    trust_remote_code=True,\n",
    "    load_in_4bit=True,  # 4bit量化\n",
    "    torch_dtype=\"auto\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建pipeline\n",
    "pipe = pipeline(\n",
    "    \"text-generation\",\n",
    "    model=model,\n",
    "    tokenizer=tokenizer,\n",
    "    max_new_tokens=512,\n",
    "    temperature=0.7,\n",
    "    do_sample=True\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"✅ Embedding模型加载完成：{embedding_model.get_sentence_embedding_dimension()}维\")\n",
    "print(f\"✅ 大模型加载完成：{model_name}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📄 Step 2: 准备示例文档数据\n",
    "\n",
    "为了演示，我们创建一些技术文档内容。你可以替换为自己的真实文档（PDF、TXT等）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 示例技术文档数据\n",
    "docs = [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"content\": \"Transformer是现代大模型的核心架构，由自注意力机制、前馈神经网络和层归一化组成。自注意力机制允许模型在处理每个词时关注句子中的其他词，从而捕捉长距离依赖关系。\",\n",
    "        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"transformer_basics.md\", \"page\": 1}\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"content\": \"RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation）检索增强生成技术通过先检索相关知识再生成回答，有效解决了大模型的时效性和幻觉问题。典型流程包括：文档分块→向量嵌入→相似度检索→上下文增强→生成回答。\",\n",
    "        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"rag_introduction.md\", \"page\": 1}\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"content\": \"ChromaDB是一个开源的向量数据库，专为AI应用设计。它支持多种向量相似度计算方法，包括余弦相似度和欧几里得距离。ChromaDB的优势是简单易用、支持持久化存储，适合中小规模的RAG应用。\",\n",
    "        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"chromadb_guide.md\", \"page\": 1}\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"content\": \"Embedding是将文本转换为向量的过程，语义相似的文本在向量空间中距离更近。常用的中文embedding模型包括BERT系列、RoBERTa、Sentence-BERT等。对于RAG应用，选择合适的embedding模型至关重要。\",\n",
    "        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"embedding_techniques.md\", \"page\": 1}\n",
    "    },\n",
    "    {\n",
    "        \"content\": \"大模型微调分为监督微调（SFT）和人类反馈强化学习（RLHF）。SFT通过标注数据调整模型参数，RLHF通过人类偏好信号优化模型输出。微调可以让模型更好地适应特定任务和领域知识。\",\n",
    "        \"metadata\": {\"source\": \"fine_tuning.md\", \"page\": 1}\n",
    "    }\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# 打印文档信息\n",
    "print(f\"📚 准备了 {len(docs)} 篇技术文档\")\n",
    "for i, doc in enumerate(docs[:3]):  # 只显示前3篇\n",
    "    print(f\"📄 文档{i+1}: {doc['metadata']['source']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"   内容预览: {doc['content'][:50]}...\")\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🔍 Step 3: 文档分块与向量存储\n",
    "\n",
    "将文档切分成合适的大小，生成向量并存储到ChromaDB。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 初始化ChromaDB客户端\n",
    "chroma_client = chromadb.Client()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 创建或获取集合\n",
    "collection_name = \"tech_docs_rag\"\n",
    "collection = chroma_client.get_or_create_collection(name=collection_name)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 清空之前的文档（如果存在）\",
    "collection.delete()  # 删除现有数据\n",
    "\n",
    "# 文档分块函数\n",
    "def chunk_text(text, chunk_size=200, overlap=50):\n",
    "    \"\"\"将长文本分块\"\"\"\n",
    "    words = text.split()\n",
    "    chunks = []\n",
    "    current_chunk = []\n",
    "    current_size = 0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for word in words:\n",
    "        if current_size + len(word) + 1 > chunk_size:\n",
    "            chunks.append(' '.join(current_chunk))\n",
    "            current_chunk = [word]\n",
    "            current_size = len(word)\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            current_chunk.append(word)\n",
    "            current_size += len(word) + 1\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if current_chunk:\n",
    "        chunks.append(' '.join(current_chunk))\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return chunks\n",
    "\n",
    "# 处理所有文档\n",
    "all_chunks = []\n",
    "chunk_metadata = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for doc_idx, doc in enumerate(docs):\n",
    "    chunks = chunk_text(doc['content'])\n",
    "    print(f\"📄 文档{doc_idx+1} 分成 {len(chunks)} 个块\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for chunk_idx, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n",
    "        chunk_id = f\"doc_{doc_idx}_chunk_{chunk_idx}\"\n",
    "        \n",
",
    "        all_chunks.append(chunk)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 为每个块添加metadata\n",
    "        metadata = {\n",
    "            \"source\": doc['metadata']['source'],\n",
    "            \"doc_index\": str(doc_idx),\n",
    "            \"chunk_index\": str(chunk_idx),\n",
    "            \"page\": doc['metadata']['page']\n",
    "        }\n",
    "        chunk_metadata.append(metadata)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n📦 总共分成了 {len(all_chunks)} 个文本块\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 生成向量嵌入\n",
    "print(\"\\n🔄 正在生成向量嵌入...\")\n",
    "embeddings = []\n",
    "for i in tqdm(range(0, len(all_chunks), 10), desc=\"生成嵌入\"):\n",
    "    batch = all_chunks[i:i+10]\n",
    "    batch_embeddings = embedding_model.encode(batch, convert_to_tensor=True)\n",
    "    embeddings.extend(batch_embeddings)\n",
    "    \n",
    "# 转换为numpy数组\n",
    "embeddings_np = np.array([emb.numpy() for emb in embeddings])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"✅ 向量嵌入完成，维度: {embeddings_np.shape[1]}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🗂️ Step 4: 存储到向量数据库"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 将文档块和向量添加到ChromaDB\n",
    "print(\"🔄 正在存储到ChromaDB...\")\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, (chunk, embedding, metadata) in enumerate(tqdm(zip(all_chunks, embeddings, chunk_metadata))):\n",
    "    collection.add(\n",
    "        documents=[chunk],\n",
    "        embeddings=[embedding.tolist()],\n",
    "        metadatas=[metadata],\n",
    "        ids=[f\"doc_{i}\"]\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 文档存储完成！\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 验证存储的文档数量\n",
    "print(f\"\\n📊 存储统计:\")\n",
    "print(f\"   - 文档块总数: {collection.count()}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   - 集合名称: {collection_name}\")\n",
    "print(f\"   - 向量维度: {len(embeddings_np[0])}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🔍 Step 5: 实现RAG检索与生成功能"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
    "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "def rag_query(question, top_k=3):\n",
    "    \"\"\"RAG查询函数\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 1. 生成问题向量\n",
    "    question_embedding = embedding_model.encode(question, convert_to_tensor=True).numpy().tolist()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 2. 检索相关文档\n",
    "    results = collection.query(\n",
    "        query_embeddings=[question_embedding],\n",
    "        n_results=top_k,\n",
    "        include=['documents', 'metadatas', 'distances']\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 3. 构建prompt\n",
    "    context = \"\"\n",
    "    for i, (doc, meta, distance) in enumerate(zip(results['documents'][0], results['metadatas'][0], results['distances'][0])):\n",
    "        context += f\"--- 文档 {i+1} (相似度: {1-distance:.2f}) ---\\n\"\n",
    "        context += f\"来源: {meta['source']}\\n\"\n",
    "        context += f\"内容: {doc}\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    prompt = f\"\"\"请根据以下技术文档回答问题。如果文档中没有相关信息，请说明不知道。\n",
    "\n",
    "问题：{question}\n",
    "\n",
    "相关文档：\n",
    "{context}\n",
    "\n",
    "请提供详细的答案，并说明你参考了哪些文档内容。\"\"\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # 4. 生成回答\n",
    "    response = pipe(prompt, max_length=1000)[0]['generated_text']\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return response, results\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ RAG查询函数准备完成！\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🧪 Step 6: 测试RAG系统"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 测试问题列表\n",
    "test_questions = [\n",
    "    \"什么是RAG技术？\",\n",
    "    \"Transformer架构由哪些部分组成？\",\n",
    "    \"ChromaDB有什么特点？\",\n",
    "    "如何选择合适的embedding模型？\",\n",
    "    "大模型微调有哪些方法？\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"🧪 开始测试RAG系统...\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 50)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, question in enumerate(test_questions, 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n❓ 问题 {i}: {question}\")\n",
    "    print(\"-\" * 30)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        response, results = rag_query(question)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 提取生成回答（去掉prompt部分）\n",
    "        answer = response.split(\"请提供详细的答案\")[1] if \"请提供详细的答案\" in response else response\n",
    "        \n",
    "        print(f\"🤖 AI回答:\\n{answer}\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 显示检索到的文档信息\n",
    "        print(f\"\\n📚 检索到的相关文档:\")\n",
    "        for j, (meta, distance) in enumerate(zip(results['metadatas'][0], results['distances'][0])):\n",
    "            print(f\"   文档{j+1}: {meta['source']} (相似度: {1-distance:.2f})\")\n",
    "            \n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        print(f\"❌ 查询出错: {e}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 50)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 📊 Step 7: 评估与优化"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 计算检索质量 - 相关性分析\n",
    "def analyze_retrieval_quality(test_questions, k=3):\n",
    "    \"\"\"分析检索质量\"\"\"\n",
    "    stats = {\n",
    "        'avg_similarity': [],\n",
    "        'source_distribution': {}\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for question in test_questions:\n",
    "        question_embedding = embedding_model.encode(question, convert_to_tensor=True).numpy().tolist()\n",
    "        \n",
    "        results = collection.query(\n",
    "            query_embeddings=[question_embedding],\n",
    "            n_results=k,\n",
    "            include=['documents', 'metadatas', 'distances']\n",
    "        )\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 计算平均相似度\n",
    "        similarities = [1 - dist for dist in results['distances'][0]]\n",
    "        stats['avg_similarity'].append(np.mean(similarities))\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 统计文档来源\n",
    "        for meta in results['metadatas'][0]:\n",
    "            source = meta['source']\n",
    "            stats['source_distribution'][source] = stats['source_distribution'].get(source, 0) + 1\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return stats\n",
    "\n",
    "# 分析检索质量\n",
    "quality_stats = analyze_retrieval_quality(test_questions)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"📊 RAG系统质量分析:\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n📈 平均检索相似度: {np.mean(quality_stats['avg_similarity']):.2f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\n📚 文档来源分布:\")\n",
    "for source, count in quality_stats['source_distribution'].items():\n",
    "    print(f\"   {source}: {count} 次\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 优化建议\n",
    "print(f\"\\n💡 优化建议:\")\n",
    "if np.mean(quality_stats['avg_similarity']) < 0.7:\n",
    "    print(\"   - 考虑使用更好的中文embedding模型\")\n",
    "    print(\"   - 调整文档分块大小\")\n",
    "if len(quality_stats['source_distribution']) == 1:\n",
    "    print(\"   - 增加更多样化的文档数据\")\n",
    "    print(\"   - 检查检索算法参数\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n🎯 RAG系统搭建完成！\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n🔧 后续优化方向:\")\n",
    "print(\"   1. 使用更强大的embedding模型（如text2vec）\")\n",
    "print(\"   2. 实现重排序（re-ranking）提高准确性\")\n",
    "print(\"   3. 添加查询改写（query rewrite）功能\")\n",
    "print(\"   4. 支持更多文档格式（PDF、Word等）\")\n",
    "print(\"   5. 添加记忆功能，保存对话历史\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🎯 实战总结\n",
    "\n",
    "恭喜！你成功搭建了一个完整的RAG系统。这个系统包含了：\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ **文档处理**：将长文本切分成合适的块\n",
    "✅ **向量嵌入**：使用sentence-transformers生成语义向量\n",
    "✅ **向量存储**：使用ChromaDB存储和检索\n",
    "✅ **检索增强**：根据问题检索相关文档\n",
    "✅ **智能生成**：使用本地大模型生成回答\n",
    "\n",
    "这个RAG系统可以很好地解决大模型的时效性问题和幻觉问题，让AI能够基于真实知识库进行回答。\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🚀 下一步建议\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **替换真实数据**：用你自己的技术文档替换示例数据\n",
    "2. **调优参数**：尝试不同的分块大小、检索数量等\n",
    "3. **扩展功能**：添加更多文档格式支持、用户界面等\n",
    "4. **性能优化**：尝试更快的embedding模型和量化技术"
   ]
  }
